### Notes API - VS Code REST Client Collection
### Use the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) in VS Code to run these requests directly.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = YOUR_USER_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@userId = USER_MONGO_ID_HERE
@noteId = NOTE_MONGO_ID_HERE

###############################################################################
# 1. HEALTH CHECK
###############################################################################

### Health Check (Welcome & Version)
GET {{baseUrl}}

###############################################################################
# 2. AUTHENTICATION & USER MANAGEMENT
###############################################################################

### Register New User (Public - always assigned role: 'user')
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "janedoe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### User Login (Returns JWT Token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "janedoe",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### Get Authenticated User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload Profile Image (Requires multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/profile/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profileImage"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./avatar.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###############################################################################
# 3. ADMIN MANAGEMENT (Requires Admin JWT)
###############################################################################

### Create New Admin User (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/admins
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin2",
  "email": "superadmin2@example.com",
  "password": "adminpassword123"
}

### Get Admin Stats (Platform user & note breakdown)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List Users (Paginated / Search / Filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=20&status=active&q=jane
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Restore Soft-Deleted User
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Soft-Delete User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###############################################################################
# 4. NOTES MANAGEMENT (Requires User JWT - Scoped to Authenticated User)
###############################################################################

### Create a Note
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Roadmap Q3 Planning",
  "description": "Finalize feature checklist, API documentation, and architecture diagrams"
}

### List Notes (Active notes with search and pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes?page=1&limit=20&status=active&q=Roadmap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Archived Notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes?status=archived
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Deleted Notes (Trash - auto-purged after 30 days via TTL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes?status=deleted
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single Note by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Note (Active or Archived)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Roadmap Q3 Planning (Updated)",
  "description": "Reviewed and updated deployment timelines and test plans"
}

### Archive Note
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notes/{{noteId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restore Note (From Archived or Deleted -> Active)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notes/{{noteId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Soft-Delete Note (Move to Trash)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
